  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Star Constellation Immortal Venerable explains that after Sun Yuan Hua entered the derivation formation, his comprehension of human path resonated with the inheritance of Heavenly Court’s former shadow path Gu Immortal Immortal Monarch Gu Ying, and he obtained the Immortal Gu recipe of shadow puppet Gu.",
