    {
      "text": "Gu Ying appeared after Star Constellation Immortal Venerable’s era. After inspecting historical records, Star Constellation Immortal Venerable retains a deep impression of him. In his inheritance he states that although shadow path is only a small branch of dark path now, it has more potential. Shadow path is also part of light path, because there is no shadow without light, and if it developed it could fuse light path and dark path into a larger, more powerful path.",
